@host = http://localhost:5133

### List products
GET {{host}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Get one product
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Missing product
GET {{host}}/api/products/99999

### Create a product
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Desk lamp",
  "price": 19.99
}

### Reject an empty name
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 5
}

### Reject a non-positive price
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Desk lamp",
  "price": 0
}

### Supply a correlation ID
GET {{host}}/api/products
X-Correlation-ID: portfolio-demo-001

### Development-only exception demonstration
GET {{host}}/api/products/diagnostics/exception

### Protected endpoint without a user
GET {{host}}/api/products/secure-ping

### Protected endpoint with the local demo user
GET {{host}}/api/products/secure-ping
X-Demo-User: portfolio.reader
